WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:55.140
You were 10, I was 11...

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:59.250
It was in our backyard garden that we first met.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:02.220
I was crying. You alone saw me. Just you.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:02.910
Yes.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.880
Only you, my sister, knew of my tears..!

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.010
Yes!

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.170
I was 10, you were 11...

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.240
It was in May, and such a bright day.

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:25.770
It was my very first visit to the Ichinomiya family.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:30.180
Finally, the moment came,

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.950
...and you came into view.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.380
You were the beauty my mother had often mentioned.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:42.590
Who are you? This is my garden.

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.230
I'm...

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.330
Oh! I know...

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.700
...You're from the maid's family.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:51.670
Come and sit down. Right here.

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.910
I was invited to a friend's birthday party, but... guess what happened!

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:01.280
They seated me all the way at the foot of the table.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.140
That was the seat they gave me!

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.380
I have NEVER been treated so badly!

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.020
I was so upset!

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.900
I got up and left!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:13.820
Because she had a bad seat... is that all?

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.260
Listen, you'll not repeat ANY of this.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:21.000
Not to your father, your mother, your brother... No one!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.550
Miss, Miss...!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.100
You've come home already?

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.170
Remember, it's a secret!

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:32.610
Fukiko-sama! So this is where you are!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.980
I saw the driver but not you so I was worried...

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.580
Don't concern yourself.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:41.180
I didn't feel well, so I left. That's all.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:48.120
You had a regal bearing that I will never forget.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:52.760
You were only a girl of 11, who was crying so hard only a moment ago,

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.390
...yet your face was now clear and composed,

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:59.870
...because you couldn't allow the maid to see your tears of humiliation.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:04.040
My young heart trembled to see such pride...

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.080
...it thrilled me with such joy!

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:14.650
Since that day, you have filled my heart.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:20.190
Since that day, I've had eyes for no one but you.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.460
But, I didn't know...

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:33.500
I didn't know that you had fallen in love... tragically in love,

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.170
...painfully in love, with Takehiko,

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:41.110
For one brief summer, for one scant week...

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:46.550
But that was like you.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.920
You alone could have experienced such a thing.

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:55.180
<b>25. The Scarlet Lipstick</b>

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.670
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.540
I've been looking all over for you!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.740
I called over and over.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:13.440
And you haven't been at school, not since Miya-sama's birthday party.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.910
Finally, yesterday I went to your apartment...

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.780
And now I'm here. Right?

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.350
Well... yes!

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:25.320
Was there something you wanted? Something important?

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.260
Not really, I guess...

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:28.660
Later, then...

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.790
Wait! Your apartment door was open all day yesterday!

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.830
You need to shut the door when you leave!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.300
Sure, OK...

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.300
Where are you going?

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:45.770
So here you are, Misonoo-san.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:48.440
We've been looking for you.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.580
Uh... yes?

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:52.710
Miya-sama wants to see you.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.920
Oh! At the Sorority House?

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:56.950
Yes.

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.990
OK. I'll be going then.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.720
Wait... don't go right away.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:08.000
She'll be expecting you at 8 o'clock in the Sorority's Kisaragi Room.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.630
8 o'clock? In the Kisaragi Room?

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.600
That's ridiculous. That's too late!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:20.180
Go on home first. Then come back later.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.350
The main gate will be closed then!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.920
This is none of your business!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.860
She would like to discuss some important Sorority business.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:37.090
There are matters she can only discuss with you.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.130
Only with me?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:43.200
That's what Miya-sama said. That should suffice. Right?

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.730
Ok.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.810
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:20.340
Sew each stitch, one by one, from your heart,

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.510
...and give character to your needlepoint.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:26.780
Make a stitch, and think about Mom. Orihara-san...

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.010
Yes, yes...

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.710
I'm not really expecting beautiful needlepoint from you...

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.350
I can't do this stuff!

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:40.220
But shouldn't you at least be able to sew on a button for your future husband.....

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:42.690
I'm looking for a husband who can sew his own buttons.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:48.130
...and maybe some nice needlepoint on your child's lunch bag,

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:51.100
...even if the lunch is a frozen one...

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.340
What's wrong, Nanako-san?

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:55.000
What? Mmmm....

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.910
Are you worried about something?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.010
You've been looking depressed all afternoon.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:04.010
I may not be able to go see "Believe in Love" this evening.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.950
What? Today's the last day!

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.550
Did you tell Tomoko-san?

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.110
No, not yet.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.250
What's going on?

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.060
That's the movie you wanted to see...

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:17.560
Yes, but it'll be after 8 by the time the movie is over.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:20.260
Yes? So what's happening at 8?

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.460
Miya-sama.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.000
Hmm?

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.650
Miya-sama wants to see me at 8.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.740
Miya-sama? What does she want?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.100
I don't know.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.110
Do you have a second?

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.740
Huh? er... sure!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.880
Maybe you can answer a question.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.680
Who, me?

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.980
You're Misonoo-san's friend, right?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:43.750
Well... yes!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:48.760
Could you tell me... about her and Henmi Takehiko?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.680
Oh! OK.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:55.600
What luck! To get this close to Saint-Juste-sama!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.730
Well... the two of them first met when she...

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.480
Rei!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:17.520
I was looking for you. I wanted to invite you to tomorrow's practice.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:18.950
Did you know about this? <i> </i>

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.720
Did you know about this? Huh? About what?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:26.360
Takehiko taught at the cram school Nanako-san attended.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:35.200
So, she made him into her brother and pen-pal.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:39.710
Brother and pen-pal... Totally girlish, that's just like her!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:44.780
So what? It's none of my business.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:51.690
None of your business? Sure. That's nice. Bye!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.790
Rei!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.060
My Dear Brother...

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:04.100
School ended at 4, and my appointment wasn't until 8.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:08.360
I couldn't stay all that time.

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:12.170
... so I went to see "Believe in Love" with Mariko-san and Tomoko.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:17.180
I decided to leave in the middle,

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:20.050
...so I could make it to my appointment.

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:25.320
Besides... the movie "Believe in Love" was...

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:29.920
Well, it was a bit more "adult" than I expected.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.050
Who is it?

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.620
It's you.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.230
Good evening.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.430
Sorry for dropping in unexpectedly.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.530
I wanted to ask you...

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.800
What's wrong? Are you drunk?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.000
Probably.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.710
But not one drop has parted these lips...

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.180
What?

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.110
No need for a doctor.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:26.680
I get like this sometimes.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.890
I have question... for you.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:35.920
What?

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.430
So many questions...

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.000
...so I came here.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.930
I'll make coffee. Come on, come inside.

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.100
So many questions!

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.970
But I don't want to... I mustn't...

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.770
...I can't even ask you now...!

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.410
I can't do it, for her...

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.380
...for the sake of her self-respect...

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.530
I have to leave now.

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:17.800
They protested my leaving,

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.300
...but they were absorbed in the movie.

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:39.890
The Kisaragi Room?

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:41.460
Yes, you know about it?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:48.860
The Kisaragi Room in a private lounge for the head of the Sorority.

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:55.240
You'll find it at the north end on the 2nd floor...

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.090
Come in.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.190
Excuse me.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.760
Come in. Come sit down.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.300
Yes...

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.870
Come closer. Come sit down, here.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:01.540
OK... <i> </i>

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:05.340
OK... Learn from me. Come. Listen.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:15.220
What's the matter? Come closer. Right here.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.090
OK...

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:28.900
When I was a child, I had a doll with lips much like yours.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:35.940
See... beautiful, isn't it... this would suit you well.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.420
Now, close your eyes,

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:44.980
...be very still, close your lips...

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:46.780
My brother!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.660
How beautiful!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.460
It's perfect for you.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:06.230
In two years, maybe three,

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:10.310
...you'll be surprised how beautiful a lady you have become.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:16.530
...then, many fine men will be attracted to you.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.980
So...

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:22.550
Stop seeing Henmi-san.

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:35.260
But I told you... he and I...

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.770
I mean... he's only...

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.130
I know!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.370
I knew it from the start.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.140
I knew everything from the start!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.010
From the start?

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.740
Don't you understand? <i> </i>

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.380
Don't you understand? Miya-sama?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.650
I'm in love. With you.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:58.590
You're so adorable, I don't know what to do...

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.620
...even back on Orientation Day...

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.960
So... forget Henmi-san.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.550
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.310
You...

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:27.750
Get out!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.290
That magnificent bearing and composure,

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.640
...the exquisite dignity that made me tremble,

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:38.390
...such perfect pride... where is it all now?

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.600
This is... a disgrace!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.100
How could you... how could you...

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:04.250
Admit it! You love Henmi Takehiko!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:13.060
So you admitted this girl, Misonoo Nanako, into the Sorority.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:17.870
You wanted her to worship you so much that she would leave Henmi!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.570
My brother... and Miya-sama?

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.280
So that's why... I'm in the Sorority...

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.280
That's... that's terrible!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.300
Now finally, all is clear to me.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:35.520
I see your intentions and your motives.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.180
Put a stop to this right now!

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:41.120
You have degraded yourself and I can't stand it!

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.900
You would do well not to speak such lies.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:57.540
Nanako-san, you mustn't believe any of this.

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:06.750
Since you aren't going, then I will leave myself.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.500
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:31.770
Which one? <i> </i>

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:32.510
Which one? What?

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.710
Which one was it? Which ear?

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:40.250
Which one? Which ear was touched by Miya-sama's lips?

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:40.480
Which on? Which ear was... Which one??

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.520
Which one??

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:04.640
My dear Brother...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.840
...I'm losing my mind.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:12.950
Can it be true? What Saint-Juste said?

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:16.250
Miya-sama is in love with you,

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:19.650
...and that's why she chose me for the Sorority...??

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:22.120
To keep me away from you?

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:29.860
This is humiliating.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:34.870
So I wasn't actually qualified for the Sorority after all.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.070
This is humiliating.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:43.450
And... and unbearable.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:06.430
As much as I worship you, Fukiko-sama,

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:09.300
...it seems I can only hurt you.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:13.840
And now I've spoken words which can't be unspoken.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.550
My love for him...

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:31.930
I nurtured it... so deep within myself...

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.560
It grew magically, becoming a living treasure...

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:40.970
...my very own treasure...

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:44.440
My secret, invisible treasure...!

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.780
Faster! Drive faster!

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.510
Sure. OK!

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:14.970
I must resign.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.370
I must resign from the Sorority.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.240
Hi, Nanako!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:21.710
Hi.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.250
Let me fill you in on how "Believe in Love" ended!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.720
How it ended?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.450
Yeah, you left in the middle.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.990
It got so intriguing!

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:35.290
Tell me, I want to know.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:42.260
Well, you know, Elizabeth discovered that Tom had a lover,

00:21:42.260 --> 00:21:46.120
...and that lover was her best friend.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:49.520
She caught them meeting together.

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:52.170
That's...awful!

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:54.040
Yes it was!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.680
She was helpless to do anything.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:58.980
She faced the end of the relationship.

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:00.380
Guess what happened next...

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:07.820
It's so sad. She began traveling alone, still carrying his unborn child.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:12.360
And...?

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.830
That's it! That was the end.

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:17.170
That's the end?

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:38.120
Hey, Elizabeth? Are you OK?

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:41.260
Maybe tomorrow or the next day...

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:43.320
In a while, I guess.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:49.100
Thank you, Tomoko.

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:01.410
Milady! We weren't told to expect you...

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:03.610
Has something happened?

00:23:05.310 --> 00:23:06.580
Milady!

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.090
It was my treasure.

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:19.730
That treasure was mine alone!

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:24.800
They destroyed it! They... they trampled on it!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
